{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05843","headline":"胡居士卧病遗米因赠 · 王维","name":"胡居士卧病遗米因赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"了观四大因，根性何所有。\n妄计苟不生，是身孰休咎。\n色声何谓客，阴界复谁守。\n徒言莲花目，岂恶杨枝肘。\n既饱香积饭，不醉声闻酒。\n有无断常见，生灭幻梦受。\n即病即实相，趋空定狂走。\n无有一法真，无有一法垢。\n居士素通达，随宜善抖擞。\n牀上无氊卧，镉中有粥否。\n斋时不乞食，定应空漱口。\n聊持数斗米，且救浮生取。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}